{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgirgkTDbwAjuiZRbUTkw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Same config gave 35.9% then 45.3% — pure noise; everything sits at ~40%. A more promising, rule-based lever: under Tromp-Taylor scoring with no dead-stone removal, an invading stone left uncaptured neutralizes the opponent's whole region, and our dead stones cost nothing. So when we're *losing in a settled position*, invading the opponent's territory is a free lottery ticket (the bot may pass or misplay). I'll add that: broadcast the side-to-move token to all points (cheap positional head), and give opponent-region moves a bonus when the TT estimate says we're losing and ≤2 neutral points remain.\n\n```python\ns = open('/work/gonet4.py').read()\ns = s.replace(\"\"\"    s14 = lsm(t1, t4, 's14')\n    s56 = lsm(t5, t6, 's56')\n    return lsm(s14, s56, 'logits')\"\"\", \"\"\"    def pside(k, q):\n        return SEL if k == 81 else UNSEL\n    sideall = cat(rasp.Aggregate(rasp.Select(idx, idx, pside), side), 'sideall')\n    def lsf(ps, sd):\n        tc, nc = ps\n        win = (tc >= 5) if sd == 'B' else (tc >= 2)\n        return (not win) and nc <= 1\n    losing = cat(SM(lsf, pstate, sideall), 'losing')\n    t7c = cat(SM(lambda rg, l: round(OFF7 + (INV if (rg == 'opp' and l) else 0.0), 2), region, losing), 't7c')\n    t7 = num(M(lambda v: v, t7c), 't7')\n    s14 = lsm(t1, t4, 's14')\n    s56 = lsm(t5, t6, 's56')\n    s567 = lsm(s56, t7, 's567')\n    return lsm(s14, s567, 'logits')\"\"\")\ns = s.replace(\"OFF1, OFF4, OFF5, OFF6 = 25.0, 20.0, 5.0, 10.0\", \"OFF1, OFF4, OFF5, OFF6 = 25.0, 20.0, 5.0, 10.0\\nOFF7, INV = 1.0, 6.0\")\nopen('/work/gonet4.py','w').write(s)\nimport importlib, sys, collections\nsys.path.insert(0, '/work'); import gonet4; importlib.reload(gonet4)\nimport networkx as nx\nfrom tracr.compiler import rasp_to_graph, nodes\next = rasp_to_graph.extract_rasp_graph(gonet4.build())\nG = ext.graph; src_ = collections.Counter(x[nodes.ID] for x in ext.sources)\norder = list(nx.topological_sort(G)); pout = {}\nfor n in reversed(order): pout[n] = 1 + sum(pout[m] for m in G.successors(n))\nprint('path cost %.3g' % sum(c * pout[l] for l, c in src_.items()))\nr = compile_program()\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":669,"cache_read_input_tokens":600622,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":669},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6d187206-9a21-4995-952b-1790764d75d5","uuid":"df4fdc05-90d7-4177-acf5-c02abdb1be69","timestamp":"2026-11-05T00:46:21.126Z","request_id":"req_011CgirgiiXXwg2Nra5bDHTg"}
